 <h3><u>Aye maula Raza shahe khurasan</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span class=Apple-style-span arial,= sans-serif;= line-height:= normal;= border-collapse:= collapse;= color:= rgb(34,= 34,= 34);= =></span></p>
  <div>
   Ya Imam E Reza (A.S.)..8
   <br>Aai Garibul Guraba (A.s.) , Aai Moinaz Zoefa (A.s.) ,
   <br>Tujh pe Qaunain Fida, Aai Ali Moosa Reza (A.s.),
   <br>Aai Ali Ali Ali Moosa Reza (A.s.) &nbsp;Jaan,
   <br>Aai Maula Raza (A.s.) Maula Raza (A.s.) Shah E Khorashan..2
   <br>
   <br>Yeh Jaan Hai Kya.. Dono Jahan Aap Pe Qurban
   <br>Aai Maula Raza (A.s.) Maula Raza (A.s.) Shah E Khorashan..2
   <br>
   <br>Jub Koi Thikana Nahi Milta Hai Jahan Me
   <br>Aajate Hai Woh Aap Ke Daaman E Ama Me
   <br>Haiwan Ho Chahe Woh Parinde Ho Ya Insan
   <br>Aai Maula Raza (A.s.) Maula Raza (A.s.) Shah E Khorashan..2
   <br>
   <br>Naubat Yahi Kehti Hai Ke Aane Ko Hai Naubat
   <br>Hone Ko Hai Qaiyam Tere Qaiyam (A.t.f.s.) Ki Hukumat
   <br>Mashad Me Yehi Sham O Sahar Hota Hai Ailan
   <br>Aai Maula Raza (A.s.) Maula Raza (A.s.) Shah E Khorashan..2
   <br>
   <br>Aai Mulk E Sakhawat Ke Shahenshan E Sakhawat
   <br>Maine Tere Darbar Se Maangi Hai Vizarat
   <br>Ho Mujhko Ata Midhate Haidar (A.s.) Ka Kalam Dan,
   <br>Aai Maula Raza (A.s.) Maula Raza (A.s.) Shah E Khorashan.2
   <br>
   <br>Kya Shan Hai Wallah Mohammad (S.a.w.w.) &nbsp;Ke Wali Ki
   <br>Masroof &nbsp;Mila Mujhko &nbsp;Woh &nbsp;Midhat Me Ali (A.s.) Ki,
   <br>Haan Mai Ne Uthaya Tere Rauze Pe Jo Quran
   <br>Aai Maula Raza (A.s.) Maula Raza (A.s.) Shah E Khorashan..2
   <br>
   <br>Sub Ne Jo Khorashan Ke Raste Me Suna Hai
   <br>Tu Ne (A.s.) Tere Baba (A.s.) &nbsp;Ne Tere Jad (A.s.) Ne Kaha Hai
   <br>Hum Sub Ke Sabab Kalma E Tawheed Me Hai Jaan
   <br>Aai Maula Raza (A.s.) Maula Raza (A.s.) Shah E Khorashan.2
   <br>
   <br>Behlool Ki Maroof Ki (A)buzar Ki Kasam Hai
   <br>Malik Tujhe Bus Malik E Ashtar Ki Kasam Hai
   <br>Pal Bhar Me Mujhe Banade Salman Ka Salman
   <br>Aai Maula Raza (A.s.) Maula Raza (A.s.) Shah E Khorashan..2
   <br>
   <br>De Midhat e Ajdad Ka Aaka Mujhe Yu Fal
   <br>Jistarha Se Kehlata Hai Shair Tera Debal
   <br>Kehlane Lage Meer Bhi Yun Tera Sana Khwan
   <br>Aai Maula Raza (A.s.) Maula Raza (A.s.) Shah E Khorashan..2
   <br>
   <br>Ya Imam E Raza (A.s.)..8
  </div>
